inviewtextbg_blue.png/233px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"233\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/350px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"36\" /></div><div style=\"margin-left:27px;position:relative;\">崭新形象</div></div><div style=\"position:relative; margin-top:5px\"><div style=\"position:absolute; top:-2px; user-select:none; pointer-events:none;\"><img alt=\"Chatacterskinviewtextbg blue.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/233px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"233\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/350px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"36\" /></div><div style=\"margin-left:27px;position:relative;\">崭新单品</div></div></div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">可用角色：</span><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"3062\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%A2%85%E5%85%B0%E5%A6%AE\" title=\"梅兰妮\"><img alt=\"Bgequip6.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/100px-Bgequip6.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/150px-Bgequip6.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/200px-Bgequip6.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\" style=\"width:60%; padding-top:7%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%A2%85%E5%85%B0%E5%A6%AE\" title=\"梅兰妮\"><img alt=\"梅兰妮\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-306201.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-306201.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-306201.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%A2%85%E5%85%B0%E5%A6%AE\" title=\"梅兰妮\">梅兰妮</a></span></span></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">实装版本：</span>2.6</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:3em\">来源：</span>点唱机</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">所属系列：</span>21又1</div></div><div><div class=\"grey-small test-hide hide-m\">编号ID：306204</div></div></div></div><div class=\"skin-video tabber\"><h2><span id=\".E8.A7.86.E9.A2.91.E9.A2.84.E8.A7.88\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"视频预览\">视频预览</span></h2><div class=\"tabber-filter\" style=\"margin:0 -3px 4px -3px\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button selected\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"4\">技能1</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"3\">技能2</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"2\">大招</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"1\">入场</div></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"4\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3062/306204/技能一.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3062/306204/技能一 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"3\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3062/306204/技能二.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3062/306204/技能二 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"2\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3062/306204/大招.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3062/306204/大招 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"1\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3062/306204/入场.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3062/306204/入场 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\">一位怪盗当然可以是一名魔术师。<br />在塔罗所构筑的神秘学中，魔术师是沟通天与地的使者。在埃及神话中，这样的使者是托特，因为他发明了文字；而在希腊神话中，这样的使者有着另外的名字——赫尔墨斯。<br />作为一名经验丰富的大盗，梅兰妮当然知道在执行计划的过程中，任何微小的变化都足以产生不可预估的后果。因此，她必须是一名善变者，她需要察觉周遭的一切，了解正在流动的态势，再给出自己的回答。<br />她特地准备了两支花朵，分别是百合与玫瑰，据说它们象征着爱与灵魂。当然在计划中，它们只是娱乐观众的道具。</div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"306204\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-306207.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/3/35/Belonging-306207.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">花与艾西<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Blooming Acey</div></div></div><div>无估值<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>受访者亲手为艾西老师打造的舞台装扮，灵感来自于盛放的花簇。其配色高调，造型大胆，放置于聚光灯下时足以引起所有观众的注意。<br />“一种非常简单有效的视觉把戏……我在台上，却在所有人的视线之外。咳、艾西老师的确为此付出了很多。”</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-306208.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/67/Belonging-306208.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“计划”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"Trump Card\"</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />59<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一副被受访者取名为“计划”的纸牌，除了特殊的牌面，其与普通纸牌并无不同。<br />“奇迹”往往由天马行空的想象力与完美复现设计的执行力叠加而成，而受访者深谙此道。令人眼花缭乱的纸牌魔术中，她似乎永远能选出那张王牌。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-306209.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/e/ef/Belonging-306209.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">传统魔术帽<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Magician's Top Hat</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"雨滴\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Value-1.png/27px-Value-1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"雨滴\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bb/Value-1.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />15<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>常见于魔术表演的经典黑色礼帽，佩戴前务必记得先将里面的玫瑰与百合花瓣抖落。<br />从中蹦出兔子、白鸽或彩带已成了观众与表演者默认的传统，但受访者有另外的打算：“不，这是‘预期之外’的艺术。遵循传统戴上它，也只是打破预期的方式之一。”</div></div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E8.A1.A3.E7.9D.80.E6.B5.B7.E6.8A.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"衣着海报\">衣着海报</span></h2><div style=\"display:flex; gap:10px; border:1px solid #b55829; width:fit-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%BA%A2%E4%B8%8E%E7%99%BD1.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 红与白1.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%BA%A2%E4%B8%8E%E7%99%BD1.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%BA%A2%E4%B8%8E%E7%99%BD1.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%BA%A2%E4%B8%8E%E7%99%BD1.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%BA%A2%E4%B8%8E%E7%99%BD1.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%BA%A2%E4%B8%8E%E7%99%BD1.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%BA%A2%E4%B8%8E%E7%99%BD1.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%BA%A2%E4%B8%8E%E7%99%BD2.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 红与白2.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%BA%A2%E4%B8%8E%E7%99%BD2.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%BA%A2%E4%B8%8E%E7%99%BD2.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%BA%A2%E4%B8%8E%E7%99%BD2.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%BA%A2%E4%B8%8E%E7%99%BD2.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%BA%A2%E4%B8%8E%E7%99%BD2.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%BA%A2%E4%B8%8E%E7%99%BD2.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "衣着"}], "displaytitle": "<span style=\"display:inline-block\"><span style=\"display: flex;flex-direction: column;\">红与白 <small style=\"color: grey\">Red and White</small></span></span>"}}